Given the function below, produce:
1. a markdown test plan (README) listing every branch, edge case, and revert
2. one Foundry test file (test/Edge.t.sol) implementing at least 4 of those cases

function withdraw(uint256 amount) external {
  require(amount <= balances[msg.sender], "insufficient");
  balances[msg.sender] -= amount;
  (bool ok,) = payable(msg.sender).call{value: amount}("");
  require(ok, "transfer failed");
}
Deliver as a pinned repo: https://github.com/owner/repo@<commit>.
